"20.2\"></text><text x=\"24.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"34\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 34.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 20.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » nin haberi olduğu için takdimi kasr ifade ile «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"416\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 415.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 13.4 29.3 39.7 46.4 66.7 73.4 80.3 97.4 104.3 104.3 104.3 111.0 117.7 117.7 124.4 145.4 154.4 161.3 161.3 170.3 170.3 177.7 177.7 184.4 184.4 200.3 207.0 207.0 213.7 213.7 229.4 229.4 238.4 238.4 245.3 245.3 252.0 267.7 267.7 278.3 294.0 310.4 310.4 317.3 324.7 324.7 340.4 340.4 347.3 354.0 354.0 360.7 372.7 372.7 381.0 396.7 396.7 405.7 405.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 29.3 46.4 73.4 80.3 124.4 145.4 200.3 207.0 245.3 278.3 294.0 317.3 347.3 360.7 381.0 396.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 77.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.6 20.3 20.3 31.6 31.6 39.0 39.0 51.0 51.0 60.0 60.0 67.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » mazmununu anlatır. Hazreti İbrahim, bidayeten yalnız olmak ı'tibariyle « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 84.1 40.4\"><text x=\